    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325160/extras/a8a2f3223f2b84b5fbfdd31e697e9f5c.poster.avif?t=1749318828\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325160/extras/a8a2f3223f2b84b5fbfdd31e697e9f5c.webm?t=1749318828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325160/extras/a8a2f3223f2b84b5fbfdd31e697e9f5c.mp4?t=1749318828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious pyramid has surfaced in the heart of Egypt\u2019s unforgiving desert. Whispers of untold treasures hidden within its cursed chambers have drawn archaeologists\u2014and opportunists\u2014from around the world. You\u2019re a tomb raider, and time is running out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325160/extras/691a4201fe6eabd832b2826e223f7160.poster.avif?t=1749318828\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325160/extras/691a4201fe6eabd832b2826e223f7160.webm?t=1749318828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325160/extras/691a4201fe6eabd832b2826e223f7160.mp4?t=1749318828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Covenant of Anubis, you\u2019ll venture deep into the pyramid\u2019s shadowy corridors, encounter strange characters, and navigate deadly traps and puzzles. Ancient curses and restless spirits lurk in the dark, waiting for the next intruder to claim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325160/extras/e0de6dfe30aa0a1996fbcf843b1007bd.poster.avif?t=1749318828\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325160/extras/e0de6dfe30aa0a1996fbcf843b1007bd.webm?t=1749318828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325160/extras/e0de6dfe30aa0a1996fbcf843b1007bd.mp4?t=1749318828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pyramid holds more than treasure\u2014it holds the chilling remnants of those who came before you. What clues do their footprints leave behind? What dark conspiracies lie hidden beneath the pharaoh\u2019s ancient tomb? The boundaries of time and space twist and bend, trapping the unprepared in eternal darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325160/extras/6fa87427c07f346d8d0c34a351894cb7.poster.avif?t=1749318828\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325160/extras/6fa87427c07f346d8d0c34a351894cb7.webm?t=1749318828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325160/extras/6fa87427c07f346d8d0c34a351894cb7.mp4?t=1749318828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you outwit the dangers and uncover the treasure of legends, or become just another soul lost beneath the sands?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325160/extras/a8a2f3223f2b84b5fbfdd31e697e9f5c.poster.avif?t=1749318828\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325160/extras/a8a2f3223f2b84b5fbfdd31e697e9f5c.webm?t=1749318828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325160/extras/a8a2f3223f2b84b5fbfdd31e697e9f5c.mp4?t=1749318828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious pyramid has surfaced in the heart of Egypt\u2019s unforgiving desert. Whispers of untold treasures hidden within its cursed chambers have drawn archaeologists\u2014and opportunists\u2014from around the world. You\u2019re a tomb raider, and time is running out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325160/extras/691a4201fe6eabd832b2826e223f7160.poster.avif?t=1749318828\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325160/extras/691a4201fe6eabd832b2826e223f7160.webm?t=1749318828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325160/extras/691a4201fe6eabd832b2826e223f7160.mp4?t=1749318828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Covenant of Anubis, you\u2019ll venture deep into the pyramid\u2019s shadowy corridors, encounter strange characters, and navigate deadly traps and puzzles. Ancient curses and restless spirits lurk in the dark, waiting for the next intruder to claim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325160/extras/e0de6dfe30aa0a1996fbcf843b1007bd.poster.avif?t=1749318828\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325160/extras/e0de6dfe30aa0a1996fbcf843b1007bd.webm?t=1749318828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325160/extras/e0de6dfe30aa0a1996fbcf843b1007bd.mp4?t=1749318828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pyramid holds more than treasure\u2014it holds the chilling remnants of those who came before you. What clues do their footprints leave behind? What dark conspiracies lie hidden beneath the pharaoh\u2019s ancient tomb? The boundaries of time and space twist and bend, trapping the unprepared in eternal darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325160/extras/6fa87427c07f346d8d0c34a351894cb7.poster.avif?t=1749318828\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325160/extras/6fa87427c07f346d8d0c34a351894cb7.webm?t=1749318828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325160/extras/6fa87427c07f346d8d0c34a351894cb7.mp4?t=1749318828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you outwit the dangers and uncover the treasure of legends, or become just another soul lost beneath the sands?</p>",
    "short_description": "A newly unearthed pyramid draws explorers from around the world. As a seasoned tomb raider, you join the race for its hidden treasures. But something ancient stirs in the dark. Will you claim the prize\u2014or be buried with the curse?",
